<title>USA: AirTouch Communications sets $250 mln notes. [corrected 16:15 gmt 3/10]</title>
<headline>AirTouch Communications sets $250 mln notes. [corrected 16:15 gmt 3/10]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Wednesday, said lead manager Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>BORROWER AIRTOUCH COMMUNICATIONS</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.895  PAY DATE 04/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2    SPREAD +54 BP     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  YIELD 7.019 PCT   NOT CALLABLE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: OFF THE RUN OF AUGUST 2003</p>
<p>(Corrects the call and underlying status of the bond.)</p>
<p>FEATURES: MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 10 BASIS POINTS OVER THE U.S.</p>
<p>TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
